{"id":"esfuerzo","lemma":"esfuerzo","pos":"noun","rank":1437,"glosses":["effort, endeavor"],"ipa":"/esˈfweɾθo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"esfuerzos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-esfuerzo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Gracias por el esfuerzo.","en":"Thanks for the effort.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460837","words":[{"g":"thank you, thanks"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Su éxito depende de sus esfuerzos.","en":"His success depends on his efforts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687729","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"success"},{"g":"to depend","l":"depender"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"Nada se consigue sin esfuerzo.","en":"Nothing is achieved without effort.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1479","words":[{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to achieve","l":"conseguir"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Sus esfuerzos fueron en vano.","en":"His efforts were in vain.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152176","words":[{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"in vain"]]},{"text":"Él hizo su mejor esfuerzo.","en":"He will do his best.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"better"},null]}]}